      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[De judiciis observandis quæ apud Greateleiam edita fuerent.] [Q/Br] Et hoc inprimis est, ut observentur omnia iudicia, quæ apud Greateleiam posita fuerunt, præter mercatum civitatis et diei Dominicæ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And first of all; all the decrees shall be observed, which were agreed at Grately, except those which relate to trading in a town and trading on Sunday.</ab>
      </div>
